• No letter: Applies to all 4 sides.
• t, b, l, r: Top, Bottom, Left, Right.
• x, y: Horizontal (left/right) or Vertical (top/bottom).

Tailwind Class      What it does                  CSS Equivalent
border              1px border on all sides       border-width: 1px;
border-2            2px border on all sides       border-width: 2px;
border-0            Removes all borders           border-width: 0px;
border-t            1px border on the top         border-top-width: 1px;
border-b-2          2px border on the bottom      border-bottom-width: 2px;
border-l            1px border on the left        border-left-width: 1px;
border-r-4          4px border on the right       border-right-width: 4px;
border-x            1px border on left & right    border-left: 1px; border-right: 1px;
border-y-0          Removes top & bottom borders  border-top: 0px; border-bottom: 0px;



